==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|agrounde|lang=enm}}, {{term|on grounde||on ground|lang=enm}}, equivalent to {{prefix|a|ground}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{nautical}} Resting on the [[bottom]]. (refers only to [[floating]] [[craft]]).
# {{1811}} Stuck fast, stopped, at a loss, ruined; like a boat or vessel aground.

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# {{nautical}} Resting on the [[bottom]]. (refers only to floating craft).

====Translations====
